  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T10:13:16-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T10:13:19-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Kevin, yes, this is Zelia Pina. So, um, I own a two-family up on Old Beach Road, and I rent the upstairs, and the tenant up there has been after me about this since before Christmas, so I told her I'd call. I'm on my lunch break, I'm a mail carrier, so I'm in the truck, sorry if it echoes on the speaker."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T10:13:40-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, you're fine, I can hear you. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T10:13:44-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so the streetlight out front. It's not out, it's the opposite. It's wicked bright, and it's turned in a way that it shines straight into the bedroom window. She can't sleep. I checked it myself at night, it's like a spotlight on the bed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T10:13:59-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so light's aimed wrong or maybe it's a bad fixture. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T10:14:04-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "292 Old Beach Road, by Easton's Beach side. The pole's right at the edge of the property."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T10:14:10-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 292 Old Beach Road, light shining into the upstairs bedroom. Anything on the pole, like a number tag?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T10:14:17-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] I didn't look for a number. Can you just send a crew to check the pole? Maybe it got knocked crooked or something."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T10:14:25-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, I'll put in a request for a crew to look at it. Best callback number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T10:14:31-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0164."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T10:14:32-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect, that's in. Enjoy what's left of your lunch."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T10:14:36-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Kevin."
    }
  ],
